SOURCE
------
This dataset is original and fully synthetic. It is not derived from, sampled
from, or transformed from any existing dataset, archive, repository or
measurement campaign. Every value is produced by the included generator,
generate.py, keyed to a secret that is not published: the generator reproduces
the data family, not this release.

Because there is no upstream dataset, there is no upstream licence and no
third-party attribution is owed. The source record for this dataset is:

  https://github.com/esmael-Abdlkadr/multiexponential-identifiability

LICENCE
